        <meta property="og:title" content="Von Zippen" />
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Mx3.ch" />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://mx3.ch/vonzippen" />
<meta property="og:description" content="The band follows the path of bands such as GN’R, L.A. Guns, Mötley Crüe, and Kix, unleashing the raw and pure energy within all of us! Both the band’s stage presence and its upcoming and highly anticipated EP “Ain’t Going Down No More” embody the electrifying and irresistible essence of rock ’n’ roll.

Von Zippen’s lineup:
Amos “Faze” Malorgio - vocals &amp; piano
Samuele “Hedgehog” Cambianica - guitar
Stefano “Staf” Martini - bass
Rocco Vitale - drums" />
